WEBVTT

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.290
Mr. Cranel!

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.080
Fine! Let's see how it handles this!

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:10.130
FIRE...

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:11.040
No! Don't!

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:12.330
BOLT!

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:21.080
Wh-what just happened...?

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:24.830
Not good!

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:26.290
I have to counter!

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:50.130
GET OUT OF THERE!

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.790
BELL!

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:46.210
Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?  IV

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:53.170
Everyone was the same on the day we uttered our first newborn cry

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:57.670
Just stumbling onto our backs and looking into the sky

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:02.920
As the tint of aspiration in your eyes grew deeper and deeper

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:07.920
I watched you keep drifting further away

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:12.000
Even if what you've been dreaming of

00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:16.330
Were to disappear into a pile of ashes

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:21.210
You will still press on and conquer it

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:25.250
That's what I hope

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:31.880
The small, flickering flame deep within my heart

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:37.670
Burns and twists with a brilliant red color

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:45.750
The young man who fantasized of the sky
spread his wings with yearning

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:50.000
While bearing countless scars

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:02.960
Endless

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:02.960
Brutal

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:08.880
Mr. Cranel!

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:22.210
He's alive...

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:26.750
This scarf must have just narrowly
saved him from certain death.

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:29.380
He can still be healed!

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.670
The song of a now faraway forest.

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:44.130
The comforting melody of life.

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:46.000
Noah Heal!

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:54.880
That damn twerp is still alive?! Just friggin' die already.

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:08.330
H-help...

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:23.540
S-screw this!

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.250
Dammit!

00:04:56.580 --> 00:04:58.460
H-hey! Quit staring, lugheads!

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:00.210
Get ready to hit it with everything you've got!

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:01.420
Start casting your spells!

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:09.250
It's so strong!

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:11.210
TOO strong!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:14.460
I knew it.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:18.710
Fighting against this monstrosity head on is impossible.

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:21.420
It was the same back then.

00:05:22.540 --> 00:05:24.250
When all of my friends died...

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:29.170
Don't think about it!

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:45.580
Now! It's our only chance!

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:47.080
Give it hell, you guys!

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:48.210
Right!

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.000
No! You can't!

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:00.710
DON'T DO IT!

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:16.750
Mr. Cranel!

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:52.420
No... please no...

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:57.040
STAY AWAY!

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:00.790
Get up!

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:04.880
Run for it! Right now!

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:10.920
Gale Wind... you're the...

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.710
You really are the one from that battle!

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:34.540
RUN! DO IT NOW!

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:59.500
I failed... I couldn't put a stop to
that bastard Jura and his plan...

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.630
So this is where I'm going to meet my miserable end.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:08.130
I'm sorry, Syr... Mother Mia... everyone...

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:13.420
You gave me such a nice place to call home, but I was
never able to repay you for it...

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:19.920
At least... I can be with Alise and the others now...

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:25.000
I'll be freed from the sin of killing them... at long last...

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:33.420
Bell! Bell!

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:41.830
Bell...

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:09.920
Bell...

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:24.040
Bell! Bell!

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:29.460
Come on! Don't die! Please live!

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.830
Please open your eyes...

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:38.380
Bell!

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:52.170
Marie...

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:53.130
Bell!

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:57.920
My arm is okay...

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:13.080
Thank you, Marie.

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:23.000
I'm off to fight.

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:27.750
Remember your promise... don't lose!

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.170
MS. RYU!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.920
Mr. Cranel...?

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:06.750
He's using the scarf... like a shield?!

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:17.460
It doesn't have a magic stone?!

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:38.420
Mr. Cranel...

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:41.920
Is your plan to try and take it down
in close quarters combat?

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:46.080
Bring it on.

00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:56.580
Thanks to Welf and Ms. Cassandra...

00:11:56.960 --> 00:11:58.830
I can block with this Goliath Scarf!

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:03.670
And then with the Goddess knife in my other hand...

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:05.960
I can go on the offensive!

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:08.040
I can take it down!

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:24.500
I've stopped it from jumping around,
but it still moves so fast!

00:12:30.210 --> 00:12:31.210
Bell...

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:36.170
I need to keep it in this area. Otherwise it will
definitely go after Lili and all the other adventurers!

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:38.170
And I have to prevent that no matter what!

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:39.830
I WILL defeat it here!

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:47.130
Mr. Cranel...

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:50.170
I can hardly believe how strong you've gotten...

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:01.330
It backed away!

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:05.130
I know that he... would never back off in a fight!

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:09.210
And she... would keep swinging
her sword until the very end!

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:17.130
I have to do the same.

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:23.250
Don't, Mr. Cranel! It'll just reflect it at you!

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:26.080
FIRE BOOOOLT!

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:06.830
ARGO VESTA!

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:44.580
I didn't let it charge enough!

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:47.210
Crap. I need to beat it here and now!

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:15.920
HELL YES!

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:21.170
I thought that twerp was dead meat, so I'm honestly
shocked he managed to knock this big freak on its ass!

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:22.500
Jura!

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:26.580
But it works out perfectly! Because now it belongs to me!

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:31.630
Now go! My ultimate slave!

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:35.000
I want you to tear Lion and that little snot to shreds!

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:39.750
Go on! Butcher them!

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.420
Grab them with those claws an-

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:04.380
It's still focused on me!

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:12.920
The Lambton?! It's still alive?!

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:16.290
Oh no! Did it hear the order from that tamer guy?!

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:19.830
Ms. Ryu!

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:25.170
No, Mr. Cranel! Stay back!

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:45.460
Bell...

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:48.380
BELL!

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:53.460
Just let me go already, Lady Cassandra!

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:56.460
No way! You have to stay!

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:58.920
You mustn't go to the 27th floor!

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:03.130
C-Cassandra! We don't have time for this right now!

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:07.420
I can't let any of them go down there,
no matter what happens.

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:12.500
As long as we stay here on the 25th floor,
then we should be able to avoid the disaster.

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:18.830
What's happening?

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:20.420
It's coming from below!

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:29.080
Uh oh. All this rumbling sure sounds like a Floor Boss!

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:30.920
You gotta be kidding.

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:32.750
Hey, Lil Squeak!

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:35.630
That's not possible! I made sure of it!

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:38.040
We should still have 2 weeks until it spawns again!

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:41.630
We're going to have to throw
common sense out the window at this point.

00:17:42.130 --> 00:17:42.960
Huh?

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:45.130
Think about that huge explosion from earlier...

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:48.210
Plus the weird noise that sounded like a scream...

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:51.790
This isn't the same dungeon that we're used to anymore!

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:58.000
So even though it shouldn't spawn any time soon,

00:17:58.460 --> 00:18:00.960
you're saying it's possible the Monster Rex of this floor...

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:02.750
will just show up?!

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.170
Aw, hell! Run for it!

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:11.500
Huh? What is going on?

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:14.170
Hurry! Everybody make a break for it!

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:36.500
It's climbing up here!

00:18:38.920 --> 00:18:40.330
Hightail it, you guys!

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:46.460
Hurry up, Cassandra!

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:44.500
The Monster Rex... of the 27th floor...

00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:46.750
Amphisbaena...

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:51.670
Oh no... it wasn't over yet...

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:56.750
Take heed. It is...

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:00.000
a banquet of tragedy. 

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:16.330
In a deep place that no one knows of

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:20.750
The scenario to today remains closed

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:23.500
You are not alone

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:31.880
A mix of emotions (ah) supported us

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:36.670
Definitely standing up, definitely pushing on

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:41.420
Although "definitely" is not a word I can say

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:51.250
Feeling an urge, I watched from the side
as you went without hesitation

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:54.330
To a world that is not free

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:59.330
Stopping to hear every poem whether pleasant or painful

00:20:59.330 --> 00:21:04.540
Wanting to see and decide first-hand
no matter how firmly your belief

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:08.080
Waking up to head towards the voices

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:14.830
Worrying and leaving your own marks to guide the way

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:23.080
Let's lay our hands together on the future we strongly wished for

00:22:08.210 --> 00:22:10.580
Ms. Ryu! Ms. Ryu!

00:22:11.380 --> 00:22:14.080
Please! You have to wake up!

00:22:16.790 --> 00:22:17.710
Ms. Ryu...

00:22:27.500 --> 00:22:29.000
Is that a monster...?

00:22:29.420 --> 00:22:32.580
I've never heard growing like this before.

00:22:35.670 --> 00:22:36.750
Why's it dark?

00:22:44.790 --> 00:22:47.290
The Lambton can travel between different floors.

00:22:49.250 --> 00:22:52.500
So then, did it take us somewhere else in the dungeon?

00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:56.000
If that's true... then this is...

00:22:56.500 --> 00:22:57.880
Here's a fun fact about the dungeon.

00:22:57.880 --> 00:23:01.500
Depending on the floor, the color of the terrain
and the walls is very different.

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:05.330
For example, everything is milky white
down on the 37th floor,

00:23:05.580 --> 00:23:08.130
which is why people have come
to call it the "White Palace".

00:23:08.920 --> 00:23:13.000
It's a scary place where even first-class adventurers
run the risk of dying from something.

00:23:13.460 --> 00:23:17.000
So I'm sure you won't have a chance
to see it for a long time, Bell!

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:21.330
Oh no...

00:23:22.790 --> 00:23:24.000
Oh no!

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:26.580
The White Palace!

00:23:29.710 --> 00:23:30.830
We're in...

00:23:31.790 --> 00:23:33.170
the deep floors.
